    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/d78dd9cc1db416f75897163d74d1e2fd.poster.avif?t=1729886234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/d78dd9cc1db416f75897163d74d1e2fd.webm?t=1729886234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/d78dd9cc1db416f75897163d74d1e2fd.mp4?t=1729886234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Play as a Specter </strong>- Attack while moving, jumping and dashing, throw your sword and watch it ricochet on the walls, and phase to its position, like a specter!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/1b9f5ab7e005590b3d014ad830547bd6.avif?t=1729886234\" /></span><br><br><strong>Action-packed Stages </strong>- Cross the fallen lands, through deep woods, abandoned towns and graveyards, on your way up the behemoth structure.<br><br><strong>End Stage </strong>- Face end of stage challenges with emergent gameplay and high replayability.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/addab1dc3a5ae45364f776576edce2fe.avif?t=1729886234\" /></span><br><br><strong>Sub Weapons </strong>- Find useful sub weapons along the way and make strategic decisions which to keep or replace throughout the levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/5d8f39d22a8aab6d033aa0b83a42233b.avif?t=1729886234\" /></span><br><br><strong>Assist Mode </strong>- Fine tune the difficulty on the fly, save states or even skip sections completely.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/d78dd9cc1db416f75897163d74d1e2fd.poster.avif?t=1729886234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/d78dd9cc1db416f75897163d74d1e2fd.webm?t=1729886234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/d78dd9cc1db416f75897163d74d1e2fd.mp4?t=1729886234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Play as a Specter </strong>- Attack while moving, jumping and dashing, throw your sword and watch it ricochet on the walls, and phase to its position, like a specter!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/1b9f5ab7e005590b3d014ad830547bd6.avif?t=1729886234\" /></span><br><br><strong>Action-packed Stages </strong>- Cross the fallen lands, through deep woods, abandoned towns and graveyards, on your way up the behemoth structure.<br><br><strong>End Stage </strong>- Face end of stage challenges with emergent gameplay and high replayability.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/addab1dc3a5ae45364f776576edce2fe.avif?t=1729886234\" /></span><br><br><strong>Sub Weapons </strong>- Find useful sub weapons along the way and make strategic decisions which to keep or replace throughout the levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508730/extras/5d8f39d22a8aab6d033aa0b83a42233b.avif?t=1729886234\" /></span><br><br><strong>Assist Mode </strong>- Fine tune the difficulty on the fly, save states or even skip sections completely.",
